  "snippet": "4.7(238)\n\nFrom £61image\n\nTokyoKamakura, Enoshima Trip With Train Ride, Great Buddha10 hours\n\n4.6(322)\n\nFrom £57 £47image\n\nTokyoTokyo/Shibuya: Guided Go-Kart Sightseeing Experience30 minutes - 1 hour • Small group\n\n4.5(169)\n\nFrom £47image\n\nTokyoSamurai Ninja Museum Asakusa: Samurai Sword Lesson & Tour2 hours • Small group\n\n4.8(370)\n\nFrom £39\n\nUnmissable attractions\n\nimageteamLab Planets TOKYO73 activities\n\nimageTokyo Skytree888 activities\n\nimageTokyo Imperial Palace978 activities\n\nimageMiraikan12 activities\n\nimageShinjuku Gyoen National Garden212 activities\n\n### Your Tokyo itinerary is waiting\n\nReceive a curated 48-hour itinerary featuring the most iconic experiences in Tokyo, straight to your inbox. [...] Explore Tokyo\n Places to see\n Things to do\n Trip inspiration\n\n500+ results:\n\n# Family-friendly activities, Tokyo\n\nHow GetYourGuide ranks activities\n\nActivities are ranked by popularity, customer ratings, performance, availability, diversity, and revenue (including supplier commissions). Suppliers can increase commissions as part of their marketing investment, but rankings are algorithmic with no guaranteed positions. New activities start with initial assessment rankings. Our algorithm updates regularly.\n\nimage\n\n#1 selling guided tour\n\nTokyoShinjuku Sumo Show & Experience with Photo1.5 hours\n\n4.8(1,800)\n\nFrom £56 £45image\n\nTokyoSumo Entertainment Show with Chicken Hot Pot & Geisha2 hours\n\n4.8(7,426)\n\nFrom £75image [...] 4.8(481)\n\nFrom £37 £19image\n\nTokyoExclusive Private Journey to Hakone & Mount Fuji with Driver9 - 12 hours • Private group • Pickup available\n\n4.7(53)\n\nFrom £82 £72image\n\nTokyoTokyo Asakusa: Mochi Pounding and Tasting Experience1 hour • Private group\n\n4.8(57)\n\nFrom £36image\n\nTokyoTokyo Sushi Making Experience in Ginza1.5 hours • Small group\n\n4.5Provider rating\n\nFrom £47image\n\n#1 selling water activity\n\nTokyoTokyo Bay Day/Night Cruise: Sukiyaki, Show & Odaiba Route100 minutes\n\n4.7(1,128)\n\nFrom £46image\n\nTop rated\n\nTokyoShibuya Ramen Making - From Scratch to Your Own Bowl!1.5 hours\n\n4.8(386)\n\nFrom £112 £56image\n\nTokyoTokyo, Asakusa:Ring-Making Workshop w/ Japanese Vintage Coin1 hour • Small group\n\n4.9(487)\n\nFrom £36image\n\nTokyoRoll and Authentic Sushi Making Class in Asakusa100 minutes"
